      <description>Agriculture Minister John Steenhuisen visited the Agricultural Research Council’s (ARC) Onderstepoort Veterinary Research (OVR) campus for the handover of the first locally produced foot-and-mouth (FMD) disease vaccines in more than 20 years on Friday, 6 February.</description>
